WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,900
The reward is distributed successfully. Congratulations to the host for increasing his power by one.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,900
Enough of a system! Ever since I traveled through time, every time you complete a task, you will only be rewarded with strength!

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,500
You have trained me to look like this, why do you have the nerve to call it the Great Advisor System?

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,300
A counselor works extremely hard with his brain and must have a strong body to support him.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,700
The conch holds the dragon, and the body is combined with the falling star and the dancing barrier.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:21,460
Well, that makes sense, but I’ve already finished my physical training, so why do I need to increase my strength? Withdraw!

7
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,660
Li Zhuangshi, what did you mean by your roar just now?

8
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,860
Back to Your Highness, this is the dialect we have there, it means great

9
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:30,060
I see, Mr. Li, please come here and let me introduce you to some of my colleagues in the army.

10
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:35,060
Your Highness, a certain family is now a civil advisor. According to the law, Your Highness should address a certain family as Mr.

11
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,260
Well, okay

12
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:39,030
Your Highness

13
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:43,630
The good councilor and tiger general must be the personal bodyguard specially sent by His Highness to protect us and others.

14
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:46,830
Gentlemen, I would like to introduce you to a new colleague.

15
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:50,630
From now on, this Mr. Li will be the same counselor and colleague of the Chinese army as all of you!

16
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,630
Him, the counselor!

17
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:56,030
Colleagues, congratulations, thank you for your advice when we talk to each other in the future.

18
00:00:57,030 --> 00:01:00,500
Damn, my hand is broken!

19
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,060
Sorry, sorry, I have tried my best to contain my strength. I didn’t expect Mr. to be so fragile.

20
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:09,660
Quickly send word to the military doctor, gentlemen, after you have finished your meal, please come to me quickly to discuss the great battle.

21
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:12,660
A certain family was traveling for several days, and the captain had already passed by, so he was rude.

22
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:18,260
That was food for eight people, and he directly served the food to everyone. Is he the reincarnation of the same person?

23
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,260
Colleagues, why don’t you move faster?

24
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:23,260
I'm not hungry. Mr. Li comes out to fry the knife. You eat first.

25
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:25,260
If you are really not hungry, then you will not be polite to a certain family

26
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,900
This white rice is so fragrant. Is there any more?

27
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:36,900
Why is the kitchen in this military camp so knowledgeable? How come there is only enough rations for one person?

28
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:38,900
One person? That bucket is for eight people, right?
